    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Human scum have invaded your island, and it's up to you to defend your territory! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey filled with action, exploration, and the joy of nurturing a thriving goblin community. Grow crops, raise livestock, and build a bustling farm to sustain your goblin tribe. Delve deep into the long-untouched depths, mining precious resources and discovering hidden treasures that will aid you in your fight against the encroaching humans. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engaging top-down RPG gameplay centered around exploration and construction.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/b8a0f65bca19b983b508787b5b13fd4e.poster.avif?t=1748298761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/b8a0f65bca19b983b508787b5b13fd4e.webm?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/b8a0f65bca19b983b508787b5b13fd4e.mp4?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cultivate crops, tend to livestock, and manage your farm to ensure your goblin tribe's prosperity.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/7de955097baa13ade90da8f33ccf9796.poster.avif?t=1748298761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/7de955097baa13ade90da8f33ccf9796.webm?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/7de955097baa13ade90da8f33ccf9796.mp4?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover rich mineral deposits and dig deep into underground caves for valuable resources.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/5bbfa69cdbf9c14e81d0e0fad5adfcf4.poster.avif?t=1748298761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/5bbfa69cdbf9c14e81d0e0fad5adfcf4.webm?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/5bbfa69cdbf9c14e81d0e0fad5adfcf4.mp4?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the fully-destructable terrain.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/35249dce7fc1d66f9060685ea6088b9d.poster.avif?t=1748298761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/35249dce7fc1d66f9060685ea6088b9d.webm?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/35249dce7fc1d66f9060685ea6088b9d.mp4?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in intense battles against formidable human bosses.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/33aa19d5267ed496ecc7574121afc90a.poster.avif?t=1748298761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/33aa19d5267ed496ecc7574121afc90a.webm?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/33aa19d5267ed496ecc7574121afc90a.mp4?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover human &quot;artifacts&quot; (garbage) and use them to your advantage.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/314ae0688bd0929f075eb13468fb2b07.poster.avif?t=1748298761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/314ae0688bd0929f075eb13468fb2b07.webm?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/314ae0688bd0929f075eb13468fb2b07.mp4?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join forces with up to 7 other friends in thrilling 8-player multiplayer mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your goblin's appearance and abilities to suit your playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you save the island and secure a future for goblin-kind, or will your tribe be swept away by the relentless tide of human aggression? The fate of the goblins rests in your hands!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Human scum have invaded your island, and it's up to you to defend your territory! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey filled with action, exploration, and the joy of nurturing a thriving goblin community. Grow crops, raise livestock, and build a bustling farm to sustain your goblin tribe. Delve deep into the long-untouched depths, mining precious resources and discovering hidden treasures that will aid you in your fight against the encroaching humans. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engaging top-down RPG gameplay centered around exploration and construction.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/b8a0f65bca19b983b508787b5b13fd4e.poster.avif?t=1748298761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/b8a0f65bca19b983b508787b5b13fd4e.webm?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/b8a0f65bca19b983b508787b5b13fd4e.mp4?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cultivate crops, tend to livestock, and manage your farm to ensure your goblin tribe's prosperity.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/7de955097baa13ade90da8f33ccf9796.poster.avif?t=1748298761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/7de955097baa13ade90da8f33ccf9796.webm?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/7de955097baa13ade90da8f33ccf9796.mp4?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover rich mineral deposits and dig deep into underground caves for valuable resources.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/5bbfa69cdbf9c14e81d0e0fad5adfcf4.poster.avif?t=1748298761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/5bbfa69cdbf9c14e81d0e0fad5adfcf4.webm?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/5bbfa69cdbf9c14e81d0e0fad5adfcf4.mp4?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the fully-destructable terrain.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/35249dce7fc1d66f9060685ea6088b9d.poster.avif?t=1748298761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/35249dce7fc1d66f9060685ea6088b9d.webm?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/35249dce7fc1d66f9060685ea6088b9d.mp4?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in intense battles against formidable human bosses.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/33aa19d5267ed496ecc7574121afc90a.poster.avif?t=1748298761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/33aa19d5267ed496ecc7574121afc90a.webm?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/33aa19d5267ed496ecc7574121afc90a.mp4?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover human &quot;artifacts&quot; (garbage) and use them to your advantage.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/314ae0688bd0929f075eb13468fb2b07.poster.avif?t=1748298761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/314ae0688bd0929f075eb13468fb2b07.webm?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/314ae0688bd0929f075eb13468fb2b07.mp4?t=1748298761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join forces with up to 7 other friends in thrilling 8-player multiplayer mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your goblin's appearance and abilities to suit your playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you save the island and secure a future for goblin-kind, or will your tribe be swept away by the relentless tide of human aggression? The fate of the goblins rests in your hands!</p>",
